# Next.js Frontend

## Apps

| App | Port | API env var |
|-----|------|-------------|
| `apps/admin` | 3000 | `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` |
| `apps/merchant` | 3002 | `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` |
| `apps/store` | 3003 | `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` (Phase 2) |

## Structure

- App Router only (`app/` directory)
- Feature routes: `app/(crm)/contacts/page.tsx`
- Shared UI from `@meridian/ui`; app-specific in `components/`
- Server Components by default; `'use client'` only when needed

## Data fetching

- Server Components: fetch with cookies forwarded to API
- Client forms: React Hook Form + Zod resolver from `@meridian/shared`
- Mutations: server actions or client fetch with toast feedback

## Auth per portal

- Admin: platform JWT in `admin_access_token` cookie
- Merchant: merchant JWT in `merchant_access_token` cookie
- Middleware in each app validates cookie and redirects to `/login`

## UI spec

- Before building UI, read `apps/ui-spec/` per `.cursor/rules/ui-spec.mdc`
- Use components and tokens from ui-spec; do not use Figma
- Mirror primitive APIs from `apps/ui-spec/src/components/ui/`

## Rules

- Import shared types from `@meridian/shared`
- No inline styles; Tailwind utilities only
- Match `docs/design/` wireframes and ui-spec tokens
- Skeleton loaders for tables, not spinners
